_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/extras/c4911f897d129cf1b07c7644b999f4d2.poster.avif?t=1565346301\" width=416 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/extras/c4911f897d129cf1b07c7644b999f4d2.webm?t=1565346301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/extras/c4911f897d129cf1b07c7644b999f4d2.mp4?t=1565346301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/extras/c390b4030ff7ce39049cafa2433ac686.poster.avif?t=1565346301\" width=416 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/extras/c390b4030ff7ce39049cafa2433ac686.webm?t=1565346301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/extras/c390b4030ff7ce39049cafa2433ac686.mp4?t=1565346301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Learn the ropes and hone your skillset in Challenge Mode.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/extras/4b18b8908fb2197020b88cb3559bc38c.poster.avif?t=1565346301\" width=416 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/extras/4b18b8908fb2197020b88cb3559bc38c.webm?t=1565346301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/extras/4b18b8908fb2197020b88cb3559bc38c.mp4?t=1565346301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Compete on varied battlefields that each sport a myriad of different hazards, such as lasers, tentacles and reflective mirrors. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/extras/9d8a397b2e7fad9fd9e2b00932ed94d4.poster.avif?t=1565346301\" width=416 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/extras/9d8a397b2e7fad9fd9e2b00932ed94d4.webm?t=1565346301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/extras/9d8a397b2e7fad9fd9e2b00932ed94d4.mp4?t=1565346301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>A selection of varied game modes, customizable rulesets and a fully developed level editor allow you to tailor your own experience.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/extras/a110e30a2b1a9ccbee937beeca0532b7.poster.avif?t=1565346301\" width=416 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/extras/a110e30a2b1a9ccbee937beeca0532b7.webm?t=1565346301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/extras/a110e30a2b1a9ccbee937beeca0532b7.mp4?t=1565346301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["PunchButton Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079610/header.jpg?t=1565346301","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1079610/235283/d80b02c53be85cd71d6f194386b424262af5298e/1751185625/dash_av1.mpd?t=1564241983","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1079610/235283/d80b02c53be85cd71d6f194386b424262af52